{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 总纲MOC | 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Memory 机制 MOC\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> moc\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Memory机制\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> meta/moc\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/memory\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/记忆系统</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">总纲MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Memory 机制 MOC\" dir=\"auto\">Memory 机制 MOC</h1>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p>Agent Memory 系统是 Agent 能够持续学习、积累经验、保持上下文连贯性的核心基础设施。本专题覆盖从基础概念到完整架构设计的 <strong>8 道面试题</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"核心概念\" dir=\"auto\">核心概念</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent Memory 通常分为三层：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>短期记忆 (STM)</strong> — 对话上下文、Scratchpad</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>长期记忆 (LTM)</strong> — 向量数据库、知识图谱</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>外部记忆</strong> — 文件系统、数据库、搜索引擎</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"面试题集\" dir=\"auto\">面试题集</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"基础\" dir=\"auto\">基础</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>题目</th>\n<th>重要性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Q08-短期记忆与长期记忆\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/Q08-%E7%9F%AD%E6%9C%9F%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E4%B8%8E%E9%95%BF%E6%9C%9F%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/Q08-%E7%9F%AD%E6%9C%9F%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E4%B8%8E%E9%95%BF%E6%9C%9F%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">短期记忆与长期记忆</a></td>\n<td>STM vs LTM 的区别与实现方案</td>\n<td>high</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"中级\" dir=\"auto\">中级</h3>\n<table>\n<thea